<p>Take an offensive stance. As you attack your foes, you knock your target and foes adjacent to them in a frontal arc back (up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 1, 2, 3, 4</acronym> grids).</p><p>This consumes stamina rapidly (-1 stamina/turn).</p>